API Endpoints — Postman Reference

Base URL:

http://localhost:8000

API Prefix:

/api/v1
1. Health Check

GET /api/v1/health
Check API and database connectivity.

2. Authentication

POST /api/v1/auth/register
Create a new recruiter account.

POST /api/v1/auth/login
Login and receive access and refresh tokens.

POST /api/v1/auth/refresh
Generate a new access token using the refresh token.

POST /api/v1/auth/logout
Invalidate the user's refresh tokens.

POST /api/v1/auth/forgot-password
Request an OTP for password reset.

POST /api/v1/auth/verify-otp
Verify the password-reset OTP and receive a reset token.

POST /api/v1/auth/reset-password
Reset the password using the reset token.

POST /api/v1/auth/change-password
Change the current user's password. Requires authentication.

3. Users

GET /api/v1/users/me
Get the currently authenticated user's profile.

PATCH /api/v1/users/me
Update the current user's profile.

GET /api/v1/users/
List all users. Admin only.

GET /api/v1/users/{id}
Get details of a specific user. Admin only.

PATCH /api/v1/users/{id}/block
Block or unblock a user. Admin only.

4. Roles

GET /api/v1/users/roles/
List all available roles.

POST /api/v1/users/roles/
Create a new role. Admin only.

PATCH /api/v1/users/roles/{id}
Update an existing role. Admin only.

DELETE /api/v1/users/roles/{id}
Delete a role. Admin only.

5. Permissions

GET /api/v1/users/permissions/
List all available permissions.

6. Companies

GET /api/v1/users/companies/
List all companies. Admin only.

POST /api/v1/users/companies/
Create a new company. Admin only.

PATCH /api/v1/users/companies/{id}
Update company information. Admin only.

DELETE /api/v1/users/companies/{id}
Soft-delete a company. Admin only.

7. Jobs

POST /api/v1/jobs
Create a new job and run the Job Analysis Agent.

GET /api/v1/jobs
List jobs belonging to the current company.

GET /api/v1/jobs/{job_id}
Get job details, including structured job requirements.

POST /api/v1/jobs/{job_id}/resumes
Upload resumes for a specific job.

POST /api/v1/jobs/{job_id}/screen
Screen all candidates against the job requirements.

GET /api/v1/jobs/{job_id}/candidates
Get ranked candidates and their screening scores.

8. Candidates

GET /api/v1/candidates/{candidate_id}
Get the complete candidate profile.

GET /api/v1/candidates/{candidate_id}/score?job_id={job_id}
Get the explainable candidate score for a specific job.

POST /api/v1/candidates/compare
Compare two or more candidates for a specific job.

9. Candidate Search & AI Chat

POST /api/v1/search/candidates
Perform semantic candidate search and return ranked candidates.

POST /api/v1/search/chat
Chat with candidate data using Agentic RAG.

POST /api/v1/search/chat/stream
Stream Agentic RAG responses using Server-Sent Events (SSE).

10. Resume Processing

GET /api/v1/processing/{resume_id}
Check the processing status of an uploaded resume.

11. Interviews

POST /api/v1/interviews
Create an interview and generate AI-powered interview questions.

GET /api/v1/interviews/{id}
Get interview details and generated questions.

POST /api/v1/interviews/{id}/answers
Submit candidate interview answers.

POST /api/v1/interviews/{id}/evaluate
Run the AI Evaluation Agent to evaluate the candidate's answers.